1
00:00:00,510 --> 00:00:03,910
(Stuart:)Maybe it's time to
do the wrong thing.

2
00:00:10,585 --> 00:00:13,725
(Amy:)Like you're doing right now?

3
00:00:15,623 --> 00:00:18,223
(Leonard:)Exactly.

4
00:00:21,629 --> 00:00:23,929
(Leonard:)I asked you over and
over if you were okay.

5
00:00:23,998 --> 00:00:26,238
(Leonard:)Why would you go through with
the wedding if you weren't?

6
00:00:26,301 --> 00:00:29,341
(Penny:)I thought I was okay,
but it turns out I'm not.

7
00:00:29,404 --> 00:00:32,074
(Leonard:)Okay, listen, I may not
have been entirely faithful,

8
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:34,610
(Amy:)but you,
you are not easy to lift!

9
00:00:39,447 --> 00:00:40,447
Wow!

10
00:00:40,514 --> 00:00:42,484
(Sheldon:)Well, marriage must agree
with you.

11
00:00:42,550 --> 00:00:45,650
(Sheldon:)Well, you are just glowing.

12
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:50,990
(Leonard:)I'm not glowing.

13
00:00:51,059 --> 00:00:52,589
(Leonard:)I'm upset.

14
00:00:52,660 --> 00:01:04,020
(Sheldon:)Well, whatever it is,
it agrees with you.

